2026-09-23T12:03:55.2413719Z     Features
2026-09-23T12:03:55.2413806Z     --------
2026-09-23T12:03:55.2413889Z     
2026-09-23T12:03:55.2414356Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-23T12:03:55.2414435Z     
